(77, 57, 'blur-comments-vscode', 'blur-comments-vscode-yiwcxb', 'Primary language: TypeScript.', 'Primary language: TypeScript. # Comment Blur A VS Code extension that blurs comments starting with a specific marker (`//!`) to help you focus on your code while keeping sensitive or distracting comments hidden.', 'Primary language: TypeScript. # Comment Blur A VS Code extension that blurs comments starting with a specific marker (`//!`) to help you focus on your code while keeping sensitive or distracting comments hidden. ## Features - **Selective Comment Blurring**: Automatically blurs any comment line that starts with `//!` - **Click to Reveal**: Click on any blurred comment to temporarily reveal it - **Click to Hide**: Click again on a revealed comment to blur it back - **Global Toggle**: Use `Ctrl+Shift+B` (or `Cmd+Shift+B` on Mac) to toggle all blurred comments on/off - **Real-time Updates**: Decorations update automatically as you type - **Multi-file Support**: Works across all open editors and files ## Usage ### Mark Comments for Blurring Add `//!` at the start of any comment line you want to blur: ```javascript // This is a normal comment - always visible //!', 'Primary language: TypeScript. # Comment Blur A VS Code extension that blurs comments starting with a specific marker (`//!`) to help you focus on your code while keeping sensitive or distracting comments hidden.', '[\"TypeScript\",\"JavaScript\",\"TypeScript\"]', NULL, 'Primary language: TypeScript.', '[\"Followed a test-driven workflow\"]', NULL, 'https://github.com/MrPunyapal/blur-comments-vscode', 'published', '2026-01-24 10:26:46', NULL, 96, 'unverified', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-08-29 02:24:17', '2026-08-29 02:24:17'),
(78, 57, 'pest-talk', 'pest-talk-thifyz', 'Primary language: Blade.', 'Primary language: Blade. ## About Laravel Laravel is a web application framework with expressive, elegant syntax.', 'Primary language: Blade. ## About Laravel Laravel is a web application framework with expressive, elegant syntax. We believe development must be an enjoyable and creative experience to be truly fulfilling.', 'Primary language: Blade. ## About Laravel Laravel is a web application framework with expressive, elegant syntax.', '[\"Blade\",\"Laravel\",\"PHP\",\"JavaScript\",\"Go\"]', NULL, 'Primary language: Blade.', '[\"Used queues for asynchronous work\",\"Cached hot queries to cut latency\",\"Wrapped external calls behind services\",\"Followed a test-driven workflow\"]', NULL, 'https://github.com/MrPunyapal/pest-talk', 'published', '2025-11-29 14:56:37', NULL, 100, 'unverified', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-08-29 02:24:25', '2026-08-29 02:24:25'),
(79, 57, 'livewire-infinite-scrolling', 'livewire-infinite-scrolling-in1vgi', 'Primary language: Blade.', 'Primary language: Blade. ## About Laravel Laravel is a web application framework with expressive, elegant syntax.', 'Primary language: Blade. ## About Laravel Laravel is a web application framework with expressive, elegant syntax. We believe development must be an enjoyable and creative experience to be truly fulfilling.', 'Primary language: Blade. ## About Laravel Laravel is a web application framework with expressive, elegant syntax.', '[\"Blade\",\"Laravel\",\"PHP\",\"JavaScript\",\"Go\"]', NULL, 'Primary language: Blade.', '[\"Used queues for asynchronous work\",\"Cached hot queries to cut latency\",\"Wrapped external calls behind services\",\"Followed a test-driven workflow\"]', NULL, 'https://github.com/MrPunyapal/livewire-infinite-scrolling', 'published', '2025-11-15 04:22:59', NULL, 100, 'unverified', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-08-29 02:24:36', '2026-08-29 02:24:36'),
(80, 57, 'laravel-jobs-to-discord', 'laravel-jobs-to-discord-bg0amq', 'Primary language: PHP.', 'Primary language: PHP. **Laravel Jobs to Discord** is a simple Laravel application that fetches job listings from Laravel job RSS feeds and sends them to Discord via webhooks.', 'Primary language: PHP. **Laravel Jobs to Discord** is a simple Laravel application that fetches job listings from Laravel job RSS feeds and sends them to Discord via webhooks. Built with strict type safety and comprehensive testing.', 'Primary language: PHP. **Laravel Jobs to Discord** is a simple Laravel application that fetches job listings from Laravel job RSS feeds and sends them to Discord via webhooks.', '[\"PHP\",\"Laravel\",\"PHP\",\"Go\"]', NULL, 'Primary language: PHP.', '[\"Used queues for asynchronous work\",\"Followed a test-driven workflow\"]', NULL, 'https://github.com/MrPunyapal/laravel-jobs-to-discord', 'published', '2025-10-13 14:32:18', NULL, 100, 'unverified', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-08-29 02:24:41', '2026-08-29 02:24:41'),
