(82, 57, 'livewire-crud-mary-ui', 'livewire-crud-mary-ui-dhplux', 'Example of crud operations with TALL Stack', 'Example of crud operations with TALL Stack Primary language: PHP. Topics: alpine, crud, laravel, livewire, tailwind, tall-stack.', 'Example of crud operations with TALL Stack Primary language: PHP. Topics: alpine, crud, laravel, livewire, tailwind, tall-stack. # Crud Example of livewire best practices (TALL Stack) ## Installation - Clone the repo ```bash git clone https://github.com/mr-punyapal/livewire-crud.git && cd livewire-crud ``` - Install composer dependencies ```bash composer install ``` - Install npm dependencies ```bash npm install ``` - Create a copy of your .env file ```bash cp .env.example .env ``` - Generate an app encryption key ```bash php artisan key:generate ``` - Create an empty database for our application - In the .env file, add database information to allow Laravel to connect to the database - Migrate the database ```bash php artisan migrate ``` - Seed the database ```bash php artisan db:seed ``` - Run the development server (Ctrl+C to close) ```bash php artisan serve ``` - Visit [http://localhost:8000](http://localhost:8000) in your browser ### Installation with Docker (Bonus) Duplicate the `.env.example` file and rename it to `.env`.', 'Example of crud operations with TALL Stack Primary language: PHP. Topics: alpine, crud, laravel, livewire, tailwind, tall-stack.', '[\"PHP\",\"alpine\",\"crud\",\"laravel\",\"livewire\",\"tailwind\",\"tall-stack\",\"Laravel\",\"PHP\",\"Livewire\",\"Tailwind CSS\",\"Docker\",\"MySQL\"]', NULL, 'Example of crud operations with TALL Stack Primary language: PHP.', '[\"Followed a test-driven workflow\"]', NULL, 'https://github.com/MrPunyapal/livewire-crud-mary-ui', 'published', '2024-10-05 06:31:40', NULL, 100, 'unverified', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-08-29 02:24:56', '2026-08-29 02:24:56'),
(83, 57, 'filament-demo', 'filament-demo-cbaccv', 'this demo was created on the stage.', 'this demo was created on the stage. Primary language: PHP.', 'this demo was created on the stage. Primary language: PHP. # Filament demo ## Steps ```bash git clone https://github.com/mr-punyapal/filament-demo.git ``` ```bash composer install ``` ```bash cp .env.example .env ``` ```bash php artisan generate:key ``` ```bash php artisan storage:link ``` setup database in .env ```bash php artisan migrate --seed ``` ```bash php artisan serv ```', 'this demo was created on the stage. Primary language: PHP.', '[\"PHP\",\"PHP\"]', NULL, 'this demo was created on the stage.', '[]', NULL, 'https://github.com/MrPunyapal/filament-demo', 'published', '2023-05-01 23:13:33', NULL, 89, 'unverified', NULL, 0, 0, '2026-08-29 02:25:10', '2026-08-29 02:25:10');

